  "description": "A comprehensive C# library enhancing functional programming capabilities with\n      type-safe monads (Maybe, Result), discriminated unions (Any), and robust error handling.\n      Features include: domain-driven design support, enhanced Entity Framework integration,\n      testable time management, JSON utilities, and LINQ extensions. Built for modern C# development\n      with focus on maintainability, testability, and functional programming principles.",
